		}
		{
			title: "盔甲修改模组 (Armor Modifications)"
			x: -2.0d
			y: -5.0d
			subtitle: "填充、板甲、潜行或结晶型"
			description: [
				"在 War Dance 项目中，&a大多数盔甲都会附带多种&r &6盔甲属性&r &a，按住 [Shift] 即可查看&r。"
				"{image:wardance:textures/quest/armor_example.png width:150 height:200 align:1}"
				"各项统计数据如下："
				"&6[吸收]&r：通常见于轻型或软质盔甲，或含量较少的金属中。 &a吸收会减少所受攻击的伤害，减少量等于你的总&r。"
				" &a&oFor exmaple, Leather armor has a total of 1.6 absorption, which results in you taking 1.6 less points of damage from each attack&r. Absorption is effective as reducing smaller more rapid attacks rather than heavy blows. &aThis is done after overall armor damage reduction occurs&r."
				""
				"&6偏转&r：通常出现在金属或镀层护甲上。 &a偏转会根据总防御值，在你周围增加一个基于护甲的额外招架范围。"
				"&a通常，你可以向任一方向偏转60度，形成120度的正面锥形防御区。总共60度的偏转，即最大值，会在两侧各增加60度的窗口，由盔甲覆盖，让你最多可以偏转240度。&r 如果偏转成功格挡了攻击，声音会略有不同，并且&a盔甲在偏转格挡时防御值始终为1，并能像盾牌一样格挡投射物&r。"
				""
				"&6碎裂&r：通常出现在结晶风格的盔甲上，或部分胸甲上以少量存在。 &a碎裂会在你受到攻击的瞬间起效，作为临时屏障抵御攻击伤害&r。"
				"&aFor example full diamond has a total shatter ticks of 32. When you first take a hit, shatter will protect you damaging attacks from enemies for 32 ticks (close to 1.5 seconds) afterwards, these attacks only being capable of dealing posture damage to you instead.&r Shatter is visually displayed as a diamond colored glow around your posture meter which goes away while it is active. &aShatter restores itself after 10 seconds of down time&r."
				""
				"&6Stealth&r will have it's own section following this one..."
			]
			dependencies: ["747B0ACA0C4C8204"]
			min_width: 500
			id: "19B8B8FF3BC6BA90"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3859B33535EED813"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "了解战争之舞的盔甲修改内容"
			}]
			rewards: [{
				id: "2EAFAAFACC3DCD85"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 100
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "招架内容：盾牌"
			icon: {
				id: "bountifulbaubles:shield_cobalt"
				Count: 1b
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
					HideFlags: 2
				}
			}
			x: 1.0d
			y: -1.0d
			subtitle: "剑与盾"
			description: [
				"&6盾牌&r在特定情况下格挡更强：&a它们能以损失架势为代价来阻挡攻击，之后在一段时间内不会受到后续攻击的架势伤害。&r"
				""
				"在属性中显示为&a&o\"每Y秒可格挡X次\"&r。例如，&a原版Minecraft盾牌格挡时承受0.8倍姿势伤害，且在此后4秒内被其阻挡的下次攻击不会造成姿势伤害&r。而&aSpartan's Shields的铁质盾牌会格挡第一击的0.7倍姿势伤害，但在6秒内的接下来两次攻击将不造成任何姿势伤害。&r"
				"但是，&4如果护盾在持续时间内未能格挡，剩余时间内将进入冷却期&r，使战斗者处于暴露状态。"
				""
				"&aShields are also capable of blocking projectiles and other ranged attacks, either deflecting, destroying or triggering them&r while taking a varying amount of parries from the shield's current count depending on what the projectile is &3&o(this is all in the configs if you want a more in-depth inspection of the various projectiles)&r. However &4shields are incapable of parrying piercing projectiles&r such as those from enchanted crossbows or special arrows, and &4certain explosives or powerful projectiles will simply explode or trigger on impact&r dealing damage anyway."
				"{image:wardance:textures/quest/parry_this.png width:100 height:100 align:1}"
				"尽管可以格挡现有的攻击，&a你仍然可以通过常规方式举起盾牌&r。这种方式保留了盾牌耐久度消耗而非格挡机制，在某些情况下依然有益，例如抵消格挡导致的击退以便更快反击，或使用斯巴达盾牌进行盾击来造成架势伤害和击退敌人。如果你的盾牌耐久度很高，它还能连续承受更多次攻击。"
				""
				"&4You are always incapable of parrying environmental or area based damage&r using War Dance Parries. &aThis makes AoE, environment and area based magic delivered in a non-projectile format a decent counter to a highly defensive mob or player&r, strats such as Ars Nouveau runes, Psi spells, splash potions, explosives or lightning arrows close to their feet are pretty effective in these cases."
			]
			dependencies: ["00752ACF2DB44C02"]
