		{
			title: "战斗模式"
			icon: "ars_nouveau:glyph_self"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -7.0d
			subtitle: "准备好战斗了吗"
			description: [
				"&6Combat mode&r &ais activated and deactivated by pressing [Shift+R]&r. &aWhen in combat mode you have vision over other combat resources used by Project War Dance's skills and the ability to use said skills once equipped.&r"
				"{image:wardance:textures/quest/combat_mode.png width:550 height:400 align:1}"
				"首先，&a即使你的副手是空的，在战斗模式下右键仍然可以挥舞武器。&r"
				""
				"&aHolding Tab opens up your &6skill wheel&r. &aSkills can be selected by pressing&r &6[Home]&r &ato open the skill equip menu&r. &aTo use a skill, simply open the wheel with tab, then move your mouse in the direction of the skill's equipped location and release&r. A number of skills then require a further action to activate, usually attacking an enemy in a certain way within a time limit. &aActivation and use cases are explained for each skill category, &lI strongly recommend experimentation at your own pace.&r"
				""
				"&6Combo&r显示在中间偏右。 &a无论攻击是否命中或被格挡，成功命中时该数值会上升，被攻击时则会下降&r。连击乘数越高，每次攻击产生的“力量”越多，部分技能会利用它来增强效果。如果在较高等级停留太久，连击会慢慢恢复到“S”级。"
				""
				"&6力量&r显示在左下方。 &a每次攻击都会获得力量，速度取决于武器的快慢&r。 &a使用较慢的武器攻击能产生更多力量。&r部分技能会消耗力量，部分被动能让你利用多余的力量。在一段时间内没有获得力量后，它会逐渐衰减至空。"
				""
				"&6Spirit&r 显示在右下角。 &a经过短暂延迟后，它会开始快速再生，并作为耐力或法力值，用于激活技能的资源&r。"
			]
			dependencies: ["747B0ACA0C4C8204"]
